flowchart TB
  S([Start]) --> A{Logged<br/>in?}
  A -->|No| A1[/Log in page/] --> X([End])
  A -->|Yes| B[GET /api/dashboard]
  B --> C{Request<br/>worked?}
  C -->|No| C1[/Your room could<br/>not be opened/] --> X
  C -->|Yes| D[Server works out the taste, counts<br/>searches, picks 4 paintings, builds<br/>the two made for you collections<br/>and loads their own collections]
  D --> E[/Welcome line and the member card<br/>with the month they joined/]
  E --> F[/Figures: paintings looked at, saved,<br/>searches and favourite room/]
  F --> G{Anything<br/>yet?}
  G -->|No| G1[/Look around the gallery and<br/>this room will start to fill up/] --> H
  G -->|Yes| H[/Waiting for you, and Where you've<br/>been with times like 2 hours ago/]
  H --> I[/Your taste: a bar of rooms<br/>and the top three colours/]
  I --> J[/Your collections and a link<br/>to every collection/]
  J --> K{Tab?}
  K -->|Saved| K1[/Saved page/] --> X
  K -->|Profile| K2[/Profile page/] --> X
  K -->|Stay| X
